# Build contexts rooted at this repository (docker/*.Dockerfile) receive only what those images
# copy: concierge/, prompts/, docker/, and bootstrap's patched tools.py. Secrets, the example
# env (it names model and agent addresses), the virtualenv, the upstream checkout, caches,
# telemetry captures, compose files, docs, tests, and scripts stay out.
.env
.env.*
.env.example
.venv
.upstream
.cache
.runtime/**
!.runtime/tools.py
.runtime/telemetry
**/*.jsonl
.git
.claude
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
compose*.yaml
**/*.md
frontend
tests
scripts
pyproject.toml
requirements*
